{
  "key": 43858,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_GreatMarshIsVast",
      "en_US": [
        "The Great Marsh is vast!\n",
        "How vast is it, you ask?\r",
        "Take a look from the Observatory\n",
        "and you can see for yourself!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_GreatMarshWasSea",
      "en_US": [
        "Pastoria’s Great Marsh was once\n",
        "a part of the sea.\r",
        "The seawater drained slowly away over\n",
        "time, leaving the huge marshland.\r",
        "That’s why they say there are rare\n",
        "Pokémon that you can only see here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_GraceIntro_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Would you like to battle with me?\n",
        "As a memento of your visit to Pastoria?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_GraceBattleAccepted_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll let you join my fan club if you can\n",
        "beat me!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_GraceBattleDeclined_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re not interested in Idols?\n",
        "...I think I’m going to cry."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_GracePostBattle_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, that’s me and my Pokémon!\n",
        "I hope you’ll support us!\r",
        "Just so you know, our latest single is\n",
        "titled “Jigglin’ Pokémon Wub”!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_LeeIntro_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Are we all ready to have some fun?\n",
        "Our battle will be fun! OK?!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_LeeBattleAccepted_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "OK, how shall we do this?\n",
        "Shall we do something fantastical?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_LeeBattleDeclined_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, how shall I say this...?\n",
        "It makes me all lonely, I say..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_LeePostBattle_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, let’s see!\n",
        "Which town will we go to next?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_ArturoIntro_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Come on, let’s show off our Pokémon!\n",
        "Let’s do battle, kiddo!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_ArturoBattleAccepted_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Your spirit’s vibes...\n",
        "You’ve got rock in your veins!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_ArturoBattleDeclined_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "My guitar...\n",
        "It lies broken and weeping..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_ArturoPostBattle_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Rock is about your spirit!\n",
        "Battling is about spirit, too!\f",
        "That’s why a battle is rock!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello there! I’m Fiona from Jubilife\n",
        "TV, the Fun-and-Games TV Station!\r",
        "We’re taking our quiz show all over\n",
        "Sinnoh. Answer five questions right,\r",
        "and you’ll win a fantastic prize!\r",
        "Today’s theme is the Galar\n",
        "region. Do you want to have a go?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNotYet",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello there! I’m Fiona from Jubilife TV.\r",
        "Our quiz is for Trainers\n",
        "who’ve earned the Fen Badge.\r",
        "Come back once you have it,\n",
        "and we’ll roll the cameras!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerDeclined",
      "en_US": [
        "Aww... Well, we’ll be right\n",
        "here if you change your mind!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerRollCamera",
      "en_US": [
        "Wonderful! Roll camera!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerLetsFind",
      "en_US": [
        "Let’s find out if you’re right!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerWrong",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh no, I’m sorry... That’s\n",
        "not the right answer.\r",
        "You’re welcome to try again anytime!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerWon",
      "en_US": [
        "We have a winner! Congratulations!\r",
        "Your grand prize is the three\n",
        "Pokémon I just battled you with!\r",
        "The first partners of the\n",
        "Galar region: Grookey,\r",
        "Scorbunny and Sobble!\r",
        "Talk to me when you’re\n",
        "ready to take them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNoRoom",
      "en_US": [
        "I’d love to hand over your prize, but\n",
        "your party needs room for all three!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerPrizeIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Here they are! The\n",
        "prizes for our winner!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerBye",
      "en_US": [
        "Thanks for playing! Keep\n",
        "watching Jubilife TV!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerCameraman",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m just the cameraman. Don’t mind me!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerName1",
      "en_US": [
        "First, the Chimp\n",
        "Pokémon. It’s GROOKEY!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerReceived1",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a GROOKEY!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNickname1",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this GROOKEY?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerName2",
      "en_US": [
        "Next, the Rabbit\n",
        "Pokémon. It’s SCORBUNNY!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerReceived2",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a SCORBUNNY!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNickname2",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this SCORBUNNY?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerName3",
      "en_US": [
        "Last, the Water Lizard\n",
        "Pokémon. It’s SOBBLE!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerReceived3",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a SOBBLE!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNickname3",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this SOBBLE?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion1",
      "en_US": [
        "Here we go! Question one!\r",
        "In Galar, are Gym battles held in\n",
        "huge stadiums in front of crowds?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion2",
      "en_US": [
        "Correct! Question two!\r",
        "Is Leon, the Champion of\n",
        "Galar, Hop’s older brother?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion3",
      "en_US": [
        "Right again! Question three!\r",
        "Is Wyndon, Galar’s biggest city,\n",
        "in the far south of the region?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion4",
      "en_US": [
        "Brilliant! Question four!\r",
        "Does Milo, the Turffield Gym\n",
        "Leader, use Water-type Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion5",
      "en_US": [
        "Amazing! Here’s the final question!\r",
        "Can you beat me in a Pokémon battle?"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
